    "Uniform Scale: scales the Base Size",
    "Resolution Scale: scales pixel count in width and height (Resolution mode)",
    "Fixed Dimension: keeps width, height, smaller or larger dimension fixed (Aspect Ratio mode)",
    "Size Scale: scales pixel width and height (Pixel Size mode)",
    "Reframe to Destination: stretches input to fill the output boundary so the display window matches the data window",
    "Filter: Point, Bilinear, Box, Bartlett, Catmull-Rom, Mitchell or B-spline",
